    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a new and creative card game where players are free to make cards to fight enemies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the role of a character who breaks into a magical tower with unique enemies on each floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweep away all opponents by crafting cards.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344830/extras/876d324c99999026412bc85840e33702.avif?t=1732068341\" width=800 height=408 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card Maker: Design and generate your own cards during battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Potion Juicer: Use your imagination to create the most effective potions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Assistant: Big Fish Assistant will remind you often, but you can ignore it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never Ending: Players will not fail to end the game, but climb the tower non-stop. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344830/extras/134407b5ca086e1d982fa9fe7d509e75.poster.avif?t=1732068341\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344830/extras/134407b5ca086e1d982fa9fe7d509e75.webm?t=1732068341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344830/extras/134407b5ca086e1d982fa9fe7d509e75.mp4?t=1732068341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a one-card superhero No matter how strong the enemy is, with precise preparation, often you only need one card to win. Want to try? Become a one-card superhero!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a new and creative card game where players are free to make cards to fight enemies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the role of a character who breaks into a magical tower with unique enemies on each floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweep away all opponents by crafting cards.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344830/extras/876d324c99999026412bc85840e33702.avif?t=1732068341\" width=800 height=408 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card Maker: Design and generate your own cards during battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Potion Juicer: Use your imagination to create the most effective potions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Assistant: Big Fish Assistant will remind you often, but you can ignore it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never Ending: Players will not fail to end the game, but climb the tower non-stop. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344830/extras/134407b5ca086e1d982fa9fe7d509e75.poster.avif?t=1732068341\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344830/extras/134407b5ca086e1d982fa9fe7d509e75.webm?t=1732068341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344830/extras/134407b5ca086e1d982fa9fe7d509e75.mp4?t=1732068341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a one-card superhero No matter how strong the enemy is, with precise preparation, often you only need one card to win. Want to try? Become a one-card superhero!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
